N242 B180 C-180

N243 TRANS X=R41 Y=R6 Z=R15-R64-R52/2
N244 AROT X=-90
N245 SZYLD
N246 TRAFO_OFF
N247 WECHSEL(1,3,18000)
N248 TRAFAN
N249 B180 C-180

N250 TRANS X=R41 Y=R6 Z=R15-R64-R52/2
